docs {
  # InstitutionService.ListMembers

  Staff accesses (Configuración › Usuarios), dirección only. Granting to an email without an account leaves an invitation the person accepts by signing up with it

  `/ltedu.institution.v1.InstitutionService/ListMembers` · unary · `ltedu/institution/v1/institution.proto`

  ## Request — `ListMembersRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `ListMembersResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `members` | `repeated Member` |  |
  | `grantable_roles` | `repeated string` | Role codes this page can give in the institution's kind |
  | `self_user_id` | `string` | The person asking, who cannot revoke their own access |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Member`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` | Role assignment id, or invitation id when pending |
  | `pending` | `bool` |  |
  | `user_id` | `string` |  |
  | `email` | `string` |  |
  | `full_name` | `string` |  |
  | `role` | `string` |  |
  | `since` | `string` | RFC 3339: granted or invited at; last sign-in empty when never |
  | `last_sign_in_at` | `string` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
